msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-detected-w-state/extracted-outputs/b27b5511-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah untuk eksekusi di hardware kuantum {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuits for `FakeMiami`. The snapshot behind this fake backend does not list the `reset` and `if_else` instructions that real Nighthawk processors support, so the code below adds them to its target first. The simulator then models reset as noiseless.\n"
msgstr "Transpile circuit untuk `FakeMiami`. Snapshot di balik backend tiruan ini tidak mencantumkan instruksi `reset` dan `if_else` yang didukung prosesor Nighthawk asli, jadi kode di bawah menambahkannya ke target-nya lebih dulu. Simulator lalu memodelkan reset tanpa noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The target qubit layout is a ladder: the GHZ line is a path of $n$ connected qubits, and each W qubit is a neighbor of its GHZ partner, joined by a CZ rung. Many ladders fit on the square lattice, and qubit quality varies across the device, so `choose_layout` picks one from the backend's calibration data. It estimates the expected number of errors of a ladder: the CZ errors of the edges it uses, the readout errors of every measurement, and the dephasing of the GHZ line while the fusion qubits are measured. It grows candidate GHZ lines one qubit at a time, keeping the cheapest, then gives each line its best W qubits. The code passes this layout to the transpiler for all nine circuits, so that every mode runs on the same physical qubits and the comparison between modes is fair. No SWAP gates are needed, and the CZ depth is 4 without error detection and 5 with it. The extra layer is the readout CNOT. The second CNOT of the implicit check merges with the first one into a single CZ, so the implicit and explicit circuits have the same CZ count.\n"
msgstr "Layout qubit target berupa ladder: baris GHZ adalah jalur berisi $n$ qubit yang terhubung, dan setiap qubit W bertetangga dengan pasangan GHZ-nya, dihubungkan oleh anak tangga CZ. Banyak ladder yang muat di kisi persegi, dan kualitas qubit bervariasi di seluruh perangkat, jadi `choose_layout` memilih satu dari data kalibrasi backend. Fungsi ini memperkirakan jumlah error yang diharapkan dari sebuah ladder: error CZ dari sisi yang dipakai, error pembacaan dari setiap pengukuran, dan dephasing baris GHZ saat qubit fusion diukur. Ia menumbuhkan kandidat baris GHZ satu qubit demi satu, mempertahankan yang paling murah, lalu memberi tiap baris qubit W terbaiknya. Kode meneruskan layout ini ke transpiler untuk kesembilan circuit, sehingga setiap mode berjalan di qubit fisik yang sama dan perbandingan antar mode adil. Tidak perlu Gate SWAP, dan kedalaman CZ adalah 4 tanpa deteksi error dan 5 dengan deteksi error. Layer tambahan itu adalah CNOT pembacaan. CNOT kedua dari implicit check bergabung dengan yang pertama menjadi satu CZ, jadi circuit implicit dan explicit punya jumlah CZ yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi dengan primitive Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute the expected reference with `exact_reference`, then run the circuits with `SamplerV2` in two ways: the logical circuits on a noiseless `AerSimulator`, and the transpiled circuits on `FakeMiami`, with its noise model. Each `(check, basis)` circuit is one PUB. Store the results in a dictionary with the same keys as `circuits`.\n"
msgstr "Hitung referensi yang diharapkan dengan `exact_reference`, lalu jalankan circuit dengan `SamplerV2` dengan dua cara: circuit logis di `AerSimulator` tanpa noise, dan circuit hasil transpile di `FakeMiami`, dengan model noise-nya. Setiap circuit `(check, basis)` adalah satu PUB. Simpan hasilnya dalam dictionary dengan key yang sama seperti `circuits`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Post-process dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each mode, the table reports:\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap mode, tabel melaporkan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the **acceptance**: the fraction of shots that pass the DisCo ED check\n"
msgstr "**acceptance**: fraksi shot yang lolos pemeriksaan DisCo ED\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the **success**: the fraction of accepted shots that herald the odd-parity sector, which should match the projection success rate $r_s$\n"
msgstr "**success**: fraksi shot yang diterima yang memberi herald sektor paritas ganjil, yang seharusnya cocok dengan tingkat keberhasilan proyeksi $r_s$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**P(w=1)** and **C**, computed from the shots that are both accepted and heralded\n"
msgstr "**P(w=1)** dan **C**, dihitung dari shot yang diterima sekaligus di-herald\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**F**: a lower and an upper bound on the fidelity with $|W_n\\rangle$, computed from the Hamming-weight distribution and $C$ (see `fidelity_bounds`). The paper reports this fidelity, so it is the number to compare with Ref. [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "**F**: batas bawah dan batas atas fidelity terhadap $|W_n\\rangle$, dihitung dari distribusi Hamming-weight dan $C$ (lihat `fidelity_bounds`). Paper melaporkan fidelity ini, jadi inilah angka untuk dibandingkan dengan Ref. [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The expected value of $C$ is slightly above 1. This is because the small weight-3 component of the approximate W state has $C = 3(n-3)/(n-1) > 1$ (see the comment in `exact_reference`).\n"
msgstr "Nilai $C$ yang diharapkan sedikit di atas 1. Ini karena komponen berbobot-3 yang kecil dari state W hampiran punya $C = 3(n-3)/(n-1) > 1$ (lihat komentar di `exact_reference`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, the noiseless run. Every shot passes the DisCo ED check (acceptance = 1), and all three modes agree with the expected reference up to shot noise. Only about 900 of the 4,000 shots per circuit are heralded, so $C$ carries a statistical uncertainty of about $\\pm 0.03$, and deviations of a few hundredths are expected. So the error detection never discards a good shot, and the circuits and postprocessing are correct.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, run tanpa noise. Setiap shot lolos pemeriksaan DisCo ED (acceptance = 1), dan ketiga mode cocok dengan referensi yang diharapkan sampai batas shot noise. Hanya sekitar 900 dari 4.000 shot per circuit yang di-herald, jadi $C$ punya ketidakpastian statistik sekitar $\\pm 0.03$, dan deviasi beberapa per seratus itu wajar. Jadi deteksi error tidak pernah membuang shot yang bagus, dan circuit serta postprocessing-nya sudah benar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now the noisy run. The plot shows the Hamming-weight distribution of the postselected W state (left), and the two observables $P(w=1)$ and $C$ (right), compared with the expected values (gray).\n"
msgstr "Sekarang run dengan noise. Plot menunjukkan distribusi Hamming-weight dari state W yang dipostselect (kiri), dan dua observable $P(w=1)$ dan $C$ (kanan), dibandingkan dengan nilai yang diharapkan (abu-abu).\n"

