#, no-wrap
msgid "The analysis is the same as for the small-scale example. Postselect each mode, print the table, and compare the Hamming-weight distribution and the two observables with the expected values for $n = 10$.\n"
msgstr "Analisisnya sama seperti pada contoh skala kecil. Postselect setiap mode, cetak tabelnya, dan bandingkan distribusi Hamming-weight serta kedua observable dengan nilai yang diharapkan untuk $n = 10$.\n"

